-- 2026-07-23: WP-R4 (PCPL hardening plan, D4) literal-from force-origin fix +
-- 2 newly-discovered unrelated defects (direction_of_resultant/resultant_formula missing
-- physics engine; contact_forces' to/to_expr dead field). Generated by
